<BaseLayout
  title="Easily Confused Words | Grammar Monster"
  description={description}
>
  <div class="cw-page">
    <section class="cw-hero">
      <div class="cw-shell cw-hero__grid">
        <div class="cw-hero__copy">
          <div class="cw-kicker"><span></span> EASILY CONFUSED WORDS</div>
          <h1>Similar words.<br /><em>Very different meanings.</em></h1>

          <p class="cw-lead">
            Easily confused words are word pairings that share a similar sound or spelling.
            The meanings of the words in these pairings can be very different
            (e.g., <strong>bare</strong>/<strong>bear</strong>) or close
            (e.g., <strong>breath</strong>/<strong>breathe</strong>).
          </p>

          <p class="cw-sublead">
            As the sounds, spellings, or meanings of the words in such pairings are the same
            or similar, writers often choose the wrong one, causing a writing error.
            In English, there are hundreds of pairs of easily confused words.
            Our glossary contains 220 pairs.
          </p>

          <div class="cw-hero__actions">
            <a href="#glossary">Browse all 220 pairs</a>
            <a class="cw-button--ghost" href="#top10">See the Top 10</a>
          </div>

          <div class="cw-hero__stats">
            <div><strong>220</strong><span>confused-word pairs</span></div>
            <i></i>
            <div><strong>A–Z</strong><span>searchable glossary</span></div>
            <i></i>
            <div><strong>Free</strong><span>interactive exercises</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cw-hero__visual">
          <div class="cw-orbit cw-orbit--one"></div>
          <div class="cw-orbit cw-orbit--two"></div>

          <div class="cw-art-card">
            <img src="/assets/images/easily-confused-words.webp" alt="Easily confused words illustration" />
          </div>

          <div class="cw-word cw-word--one"><span>bare</span><b>≠</b><span>bear</span></div>
          <div class="cw-word cw-word--two"><span>affect</span><b>≠</b><span>effect</span></div>
          <div class="cw-word cw-word--three"><span>your</span><b>≠</b><span>you're</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cw-top10" id="top10">
      <div class="cw-shell">
        <div class="cw-section-head">
          <div>
            <span class="cw-mini-label">TOP 10 EASILY CONFUSED WORDS</span>
